image = "res://art/guide/preparation.png"
body = "Nothing attacks during Preparation, and it lasts as long as you need. Building and upgrading belong here and only here: once the wave is walking, the roads are what they are. Ride On early for a small bonus; wait for the next wave's preview if you would rather know what is coming."
